$$\frac{1}{T}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\mathbb{E}\bigl[\|\nabla f(\theta_t)\|^2\bigr].$$
Express your final answer in terms of $\{T, r, n, \tau, G, m, \gamma, \sigma, \eta, L, d, f(\theta_0) - f^*\}$ only, written as a single expression in $\boxed{\cdots}$.

